    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#napoleon">Napoleon</a>'s alliance turned the Electorate of Bavaria into a kingdom in 1806, the second largest German state.</li><li>Montgelas built a centralised, tolerant administration, and the constitution of 1818 created one of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#germany">Germany</a>'s first parliaments.</li><li>Ludwig I and Ludwig II made Munich and the Bavarian <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#alps">Alps</a> famous for art, architecture and fantasy castles.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>The Oktoberfest began in October 1810 as a public celebration of the wedding of Crown Prince Ludwig, the future Ludwig I, to Princess Therese of Saxe-Hildburghausen.</p></aside>
    </section>

